        Returns:
        - total_active_service_episodes: Count of active service episodes
        - referral_priority_count: Breakdown by each priority level
            - routine: count
            - priority: count
            - urgent: count
            - crisis: count
            - emergency: count
            - total: sum of all

        Role-based filtering:
        - Case Worker: Only their assigned records
        - Supervisor: Their own + supervised case workers' records
        - Program Manager/Admin: All records in their organisation
